<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <title>Verify your seller account - E-market</title>
        <meta http-equiv="Content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <style type="text/css">
            body {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                min-width: 100%;
                font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
                font-size: 15px;
                line-height: 1.6;
                background-color: #ffffff;
                color: #333333;
            }
            a {
                color: #4a6cf7;
                text-decoration: none;
            }
            p {
                margin-top: 0;
                margin-bottom: 16px;
            }

            .email-outer {
                padding: 40px 16px;
            }
            .email-wrapper {
                max-width: 560px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                border-radius: 12px;
                overflow: hidden;
                box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            }
            .email-header {
                background-color: #2c3e6b;
                padding: 32px 40px;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .email-header h1 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 22px;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: #ffffff;
                letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            }
            .email-header p {
                margin: 6px 0 0;
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #a8b4d4;
            }
            .email-body {
                padding: 36px 40px;
                background-color: #f0f2f5;
            }
            .email-body p {
                color: #555555;
                font-size: 15px;
            }
            .otp-box {
                margin: 28px 0;
                padding: 20px;
                background-color: #f5f7ff;
                border: 1px solid #dde2f5;
                border-radius: 10px;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .otp-label {
                font-size: 12px;
                font-weight: 600;
                letter-spacing: 1.2px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: #8892b0;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
            }
            .otp-code {
                font-size: 36px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 10px;
                color: #2c3e6b;
            }
            .expiry-note {
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #999999;
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 0;
            }
            .divider {
                border: none;
                border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                margin: 24px 0;
            }
            .email-footer {
                background-color: #f8f9fc;
                padding: 24px 40px;
                border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
            }
            .footer-main {
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #888888;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }
            .footer-security {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #aaaaaa;
                padding: 12px 16px;
                background-color: #f0f2f5;
                border-radius: 8px;
                margin-top: 12px;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="email-outer">
            <div class="email-wrapper">
                <div class="email-header">
                    <h1>E-market</h1>
                    <p>Seller Account Verification</p>
                </div>
                <div class="email-body">
                    <p>Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
                    <p>
                        Welcome to the E-market Seller community! Use the verification code below to activate your seller account and start setting up your shop.
                        This code is valid for <strong>5 minutes</strong>.
                    </p>

                    <div class="otp-box">
                        <p class="otp-label">Your seller verification code</p>
                        <div class="otp-code"><%= otp %></div>
                    </div>

                    <p class="expiry-note">Do not share this code with anyone.</p>

                    <hr class="divider">

                    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #888888; margin-bottom: 0;">
                        If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.
                        Your seller account will not be activated without entering the code.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="email-footer">
                    <p class="footer-main">
                        Need help? Reach us at
                        <a href="mailto:supportemarket@gmail.com">supportemarket@gmail.com</a>
                    </p>
                    <div class="footer-security">
                        Not you? If you did not attempt to register as a seller on E-market, please contact our support team immediately at
                        <a href="mailto:supportemarket@gmail.com">supportemarket@gmail.com</a> so we can secure your information.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
